  "implementation": [
    "Derive four WDS system queries from the frozen SIMBAD raw-replayed identifier hints; capture actual HTTPS TSV and ReadMe bytes with bounded retry, timeout, redirects, response metadata and immutable artifacts.",
    "Replay current SIMBAD raw and V621 records before accepting any WDS hint binding, then rehash all five catalogue artifacts and independently reconstruct the candidate pack.",
    "Parse catalogue columns and units, preserve separate pair hierarchies, missing values versus zero, exact source lines and UTF-8 offsets; reject query mismatch, overflow, malformed text, duplicate pairs, forged artifact metadata and invented component members.",
    "Expose source identity, 25 catalogue pairs, full attempt history, raw SHA/bytes, filtering and failure states in the existing stellar review panel while retaining unresolved identity and hold.",
    "Register four constellation geometries and four materials with the existing resource ledger, matching the existing effect cleanup; retain failed disposal entries and label byte counts as estimates.",
    "Bind the candidate package to build056, its current source bytes and actual HTTP results, with the new catalogue raw/replay/tool references included."
  ],
